WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.272
Real decisions often depend on more than one condition.

00:00:05.272 --> 00:00:07.997
That is where and, or, and not become useful.

00:00:07.997 --> 00:00:14.537
For a bonus, both sales above one thousand and returns below fifty must be true.

00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:16.932
That is an and condition.

00:00:16.932 --> 00:00:24.767
For “needs attention,” either low sales or high returns is enough, so or makes sense.

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:28.329
The not operator reverses a Boolean result.

00:00:28.913 --> 00:00:31.935
Read these expressions as plain language first.

00:00:31.935 --> 00:00:37.595
If you can explain the business rule clearly, the Python usually becomes much easier to write.
